## Frequently asked questions

**Where are you based?**

We're based in [Merthyr Tydfil](/web-design-merthyr-tydfil/), South Wales, and work with businesses across the region and UK-wide.

**How long does a website take?**

Most projects are completed within 7–14 days depending on scope.

**Will my website work on mobile?**

Yes. Every website we build uses mobile-first design.

**Can I update the site myself?**

Yes. We provide full access and training as part of every project.

For businesses outside South Wales, we also cover [web design across Wales](/web-design-wales/), [web design North Wales](/web-design-north-wales/), and [web design Mid Wales](/web-design-mid-wales/).

We also offer web development for South Wales businesses if you need the full build handled alongside your design.

We also offer a [managed starter website for South Wales businesses](/managed-starter-websites-south-wales/) — a fully managed package from £20/month inc. VAT with no upfront costs.

